DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260808T010000
UID:1901d951df927182a14125b16c5f69f2@madamsorgan.com
DESCRIPTION:Founded in 2020 out of Anaheim Hills\, The Blue Byrdes pull fr
 om the well that classic rock dug deep – the Allman Brothers\, Stevie Ra
 y Vaughan\, Eric Clapton\, Jimi Hendrix – and run it through a younger s
 et of hands. Soulful melody\, loud honest playing\, arrangements that brea
 the. They are not reviving the old sound so much as refusing to let it sit
  still. ​ Cut from The Allman Brothers Stevie Ray Vaughan Eric Clapton J
 imi Hendrix
LOCATION:Madam's Organ Blues Bar\, 2461 18th Street NW\, Washington\, DC 2
 0009
URL:https://madamsorgan.com/events/the-bluebyrdes/
X-SOURCE:Madam's Organ
END:VEVENT
